OL,3,GNEWSACouncil received no profit share
OL,4,Afrom theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have been told a theatre is
OL,7,Fa "real asset" despite the local
OL,8,Fauthority not receiving any profit from
OL,9,Fit last year.
OL,11,FConservative group leader of Stockton
OL,12,FCouncil, Tony Riordan, outlined the
OL,13,Fprofit share agreement from 2019 which
OL,14,Fsaid the council would receive 30% of
OL,15,Fany of the Globe's earnings over
OL,16,F#600,000 from year four of opening at a
OL,17,Fmeeting on Wednesday.
OL,19,FIt has been 10 years since the council
OL,20,Ftook over the reins of the theatre's
OL,21,Frestoration, which was completed in
OL,22,F2021 after being empty since 1997.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
