OL,3,GNEWSACouncil received no profit share
OL,4,Afrom theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council's Labour deputy leader Paul
OL,7,FRowling acknowledged the council
OL,8,Freceived no profit share for the
OL,9,F2025/26 financial year but said the
OL,10,FGlobe had put the town back on the map.
